{{!-- subject: Reset your password --}}
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your password.</p>
{{#if code}}<p>Enter this code in the app:</p><p dir="ltr" data-reset-code="{{code}}" style="font-size:28px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:6px">{{code}}</p><p>The code is valid for {{codeExpiresInMinutes}} minutes. Never share it.</p>{{/if}}
<p>{{#if code}}You can also choose a new password using this link.{{else}}Choose a new password using this link.{{/if}} The link is valid for {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes.</p>{{> button url=resetUrl label="Choose a new password"}}
{{!-- footer: If you did not request this, ignore this email; your account is safe. --}}
